        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>JNF FP225-70-630, Round Satin Stainless Steel Pocket Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-3/4 Inch Round Stainless Steel Flush Pull is the perfect size for sliding pocket doors. The lip on the inside is large enough for big hands to catch hold of and that is important on larger doors. This flush pull comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware. The Satin Stainless Steel finish is easy to maintain, just wipe clean with a damp rag. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN--225-70-dimentions.gif?v=1704354728\" width=\"514\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" alt=\"JNF 225-70-630 Stainless Steel Flush Pull Dimensions\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching:  <a href=\"/products/4-5-16-inch-round-satin-stainless-steel-flush-pull-jnf-fp225-110-630\"><b>4-5/16\" Round Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Satin Stainless Steel Round Pocket Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-3/4\"(70 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 19/32\" (16 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 17-32\" (14 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Diameter: 2-1/4\" (60 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lip: 3/16\" (5 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with all necessary mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
